<title>USA: Western has 47.6 pct of K.C. Power.</title>
<headline>Western has 47.6 pct of K.C. Power.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kan. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Resources Inc said 47.6 percent, or 29.5 million, of the outstanding common shares of Kansas City Power &amp; Light Co had been tendered to it by the previously scheduled December 6 expiration date of its offer, and the exchange offer has been extended to 1700 EST/2200 GMT December 13.</p>
<p>Merger discussions between the two utilities continue, Western said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
